self.KB_CONTENT["card:779292"]={"id":"card:779292","ty":"card","sourceId":"779292","title":"『暫出/入歸還建立作業(IDL)』中的『DATECODE (TI502)』為何？","ver":"GP4以上","topic":"暫出入","keywords":["暫出入","品號","歸還"],"y":"other","answer":"* 若品號不作「DATECODE管理」，則此欄位不可輸入。","links":[],"pdfText":"","pdfPages":0,"pdfChars":0,"merged":[],"file":"kb-cards.jsonl"};
self.KB_CONTENT["card:779999"]={"id":"card:779999","ty":"card","sourceId":"779999","title":"『委外進貨單建立作業(IDL)』中的『託外進貨單號 (TH002)』為何？","ver":"GP4以上","topic":"進貨單","keywords":["進貨單","單別","單號","編號"],"y":"other","answer":"* 單別之編碼方式為「4.手動編號」須自行輸入不可空白，不可重覆，其餘自動預設單號。","links":[],"pdfText":"","pdfPages":0,"pdfChars":0,"merged":[],"file":"kb-cards.jsonl"};
self.KB_CONTENT["card:779911"]={"id":"card:779911","ty":"card","sourceId":"779911","title":"『委外進貨單建立作業(IDL)』中的『保稅碼 (TI052)』為何？","ver":"GP4以上","topic":"進貨單","keywords":["進貨單","單身","保稅","單頭"],"y":"other","answer":"* 新增時，若單頭保稅碼為Y，預設單身保稅碼也為Y。","links":[],"pdfText":"","pdfPages":0,"pdfChars":0,"merged":[],"file":"kb-cards.jsonl"};
